Abstract = {With the rapid rising quantity of urban industrial derelict land,
   restoration and improvement of the ecological environment functions
   becomes the key to sustainable urban development. This paper takes the
   restoration ecology, ecological ethics and ecological aesthetics as the
   guidance, through the selection, protection and restructuring the
   environmental features of industrial derelict land, brings forward the
