Abstract = {Which factors decide whether countries are attractive for investment
   under the Kyoto Protocol's Clean Development Mechanism (CDM)? This is
   the key question of this paper. It summarises some of the results of a
   Point Carbon report from May 2002 {[}1]. Companies in countries that are
   included in Annex I of the Kyoto Protocol (e.g. countries that have
   committed themselves to reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions) can make
   CDM investments to fulfil their emissions reductions obligations. The
