   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {With respect to the fact that pure nature has been dissolved in the
   contemporary cities, and therefore, traditional defensive ecological
   design methods should go beyond the dualism of man-mad and nature
   towards more broad and more active approaches of ecological analysis and
   planning. As a part of this revaluating process, this essay investigates
   the possibility of using landscape - the man-made nature as a
   structuring medium to construct the new order of urban ecology, and
   proposes the emerging paradigm of designed ecology to rebuild large
   scale build environment and to recollect gradually fragmented urban
   fabrics.},
