   INRETS; Meteo France; Minist Equipement, Transports \& Logement},
Abstract = {In this paper, macroscale, mesoscale and microscale approaches are
   explored and analyzed to define the most suitable aggregation method to
   estimate traffic emissions. A traffic simulation model and an emission
   factor model were integrated to estimate link speeds, emission factors,
