   18-22, 1992},
Abstract = {Thirty in-use vehicles (both petrol and diesel-powered) of the N1
   international category were tested under loaded and unloaded conditions
   (i.e, a total of 60 vehicles), using the FTP75 and urban and extra-urban
   European driving cycles. The emission factors derived are presented.
